Upstream reference: branch 1.12, commit
32ae2b4c56cb84284e865dae0d3b78770992ba1d.

This is an unofficial Forge 1.20.1 adaptation, not an official release
by the original Animania team. The port rewrites the platform integration,
registries, entities, AI and rendering for modern Minecraft while deriving
gameplay and converted model/animation resources from the original project.
See PORTING.md for the implementation notes and differences from 1.12.

Port source and maintenance: https://github.com/Steveaaaaa/Animania-Reborn

This port preserves the original `animania` resource namespace for world and
resource-pack compatibility where practical. New implementation code is also
distributed under LGPL-3.0-only.

